{"title":"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A large urn contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> balls, of which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9ca18cc32bd09bb16daed6a79a253ecae3c935c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> are red and the rest are blue. How many of the blue balls must be removed so that the percentage of red balls in the urn will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddfb0bc1f506cc5cef1d8df40c94ca0494cf12af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />? (No red balls are to be removed.)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/b/c0b91503a3df93f237b03dd781e40c011c25b18f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 28 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\  32 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\  36 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 50 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> red balls; for these red balls to comprise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddfb0bc1f506cc5cef1d8df40c94ca0494cf12af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of the urn, there must be only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> blue balls. Since there are currently <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> blue balls, this means we must remove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/d/06dc80c9f28f8faa70c1439fe99087626d74f5ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> red balls and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> blue balls. For the percentage of the red balls to double from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9ca18cc32bd09bb16daed6a79a253ecae3c935c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddfb0bc1f506cc5cef1d8df40c94ca0494cf12af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of the urn, half of the total number of balls must be removed. Therefore, the number of blue balls that need to be removed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/d/06dc80c9f28f8faa70c1439fe99087626d74f5ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> red balls out of the total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> balls. \nWe want to continuously remove blue balls until the percentage of red balls in the urn is 72%.\nTherefore, we want\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/a/51af9939d140059eb2397ef1889ccbafa45b1fd1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{36}{100-x}=\\frac{72}{100}.\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" />\nSolving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> gives that we must remove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/d/06dc80c9f28f8faa70c1439fe99087626d74f5ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" /> blue balls.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/u26afAqgTKw\">https://youtu.be/u26afAqgTKw</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A\">2018 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017132218\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 194/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2262/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 160/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20